      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_02",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그런데 오늘은 사람들이 많네요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "それにしても、今日はすごい人ですね？",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "今天這裡好多人哦？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_02_DRUID_16.ogg"
    },
    {
